1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:00,787
Did you know,

2
00:00:00,787 --> 00:00:02,707
right before Ram and Hanuman met,

3
00:00:02,707 --> 00:00:05,093
what happened? And right in front of Ram,

4
00:00:05,093 --> 00:00:07,130
why did Shabari walk into the fire?

5
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,666
Let's search Valmiki Ramayana...

6
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:12,870
By Pampa's banks, in Matang forest,

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,910
Shabari served gurus for years.

8
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,635
When Ram reached Chitrakoot,

9
00:00:16,635 --> 00:00:17,682
they passed away,

10
00:00:17,682 --> 00:00:19,900
whispering that Ram would come here.

11
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:23,590
Shabari did not know when, but we know.

12
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:25,920
Ram was on His way. And one day,

13
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:28,446
two archers arrived at the ashram doors,

14
00:00:28,446 --> 00:00:31,322
Shabari joined her hands and touched their feet.

15
00:00:31,322 --> 00:00:32,700
Of the shores of Pampa,

16
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,880
various forest fruits I have carefully saved for you.

17
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:40,292
Just this... no tasting, no leftovers.

18
00:00:40,292 --> 00:00:43,540
The tale of offering tasted fruit came later,

19
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,200
then Shabari showed it.

20
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:48,106
had not withered till today. Ram said,

21
00:00:48,106 --> 00:00:50,006
You have fully honored me.

22
00:00:50,006 --> 00:00:52,490
Now wherever you wish, go happily.

23
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:54,890
And Shabari

24
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:59,122
stepped into the fire and shining like lightning,

25
00:00:59,122 --> 00:01:00,988
she went to her gurus' realm.

26
00:01:00,988 --> 00:01:02,532
As soon as Shabari left,

27
00:01:02,532 --> 00:01:04,140
Ram walked towards Pampa,

28
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:06,740
and right there He met Hanuman.

29
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:10,052
Shabari's devotion was not in tasting berries,

30
00:01:10,052 --> 00:01:11,439
it was in that wait,

31
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:13,590
that was fulfilled after years.

